        notes: 'Source text: ''Why shouldn''t Sam be a steward?'' Jon Snow argued to Maester Aemon that Sam''s gifts — reading, writing, sums, raven-keeping — suited him for the steward order, not warrior training. Maester Aemon agreed to consider it. Sam eventually became a steward and keeper of ravens under Maester Aemon.'
